## Directory layout (main source tree)

Standard Spring PetClinic REST app, but restructured into per-endpoint "function" steps (OfficeFloor style). Root package: `org.springframework.samples.petclinic`.

```
src/main/java/.../petclinic/
├── config/            (SwaggerConfig)
├── mapper/            (OwnerMapper.java, etc. — MapStruct DTO mappers)
├── model/             (JPA entities: Owner.java, Pet, Visit, …)
├── repository/        (jdbc/, jpa/, springdatajpa/)
├── rest/
